  "details": "I've been playing VRChat for years now and streaming and creating content with VRC for almost 2 of those.  \nThere is a desperate need for a new and feature rich camera system in VRC.  While the current system is adequate it has become stale and there are other much more feature rich camera systems that can and should be implemented in VRC such as with avatar based camera systems like VRCLens or world based camera systems like the one found in the Orion Club (Personally, the camera system in Orion Club is absolutely amazing and my favorite)\nFeatures that need to be implemented:\n-Exposure Adjustment\n-Zoom Adjustment\n-Aperture Adjustment\n-Auto Focus\n-Helpful Overlays such as rule-of-thirds\nThese are just a few possible features.\nTo keep the camera system easy to use or hide the advanced features a toggle could be made to display or hide the more advanced features of the camera system.\nI believe the a more feature rich camera system with help players and content creators like myself in being able to produce more engaging and unique content.",
